WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.052
Eric and his parents stood outside their house.

2
00:00:05.053 --> 00:00:09.595
They were watching a parade.

3
00:00:09.596 --> 00:00:15.669
A band marched toward them.

4
00:00:15.670 --> 00:00:21.682
Eric saw lots of different instruments.

5
00:00:21.683 --> 00:00:29.802
And then— boom! Ba-boom! Rat-a-tat-tat!

6
00:00:29.803 --> 00:00:34.128
Drums! Drummers banged big drums and little

7
00:00:34.129 --> 00:00:37.940
drums. "Cool!" thought

8
00:00:37.941 --> 00:00:44.092
Eric. Days went

9
00:00:44.093 --> 00:00:52.043
by. Eric couldn't stop thinking about those

10
00:00:52.044 --> 00:00:56.187
drums. At dinner he tapped on the

11
00:00:56.188 --> 00:01:01.844
table. At school he tapped on his

12
00:01:01.845 --> 00:01:09.950
books. In the kitchen he banged pots

13
00:01:09.951 --> 00:01:15.144
together. "Let's go to the garage," Dad said one

14
00:01:15.145 --> 00:01:17.970
day. "Why?" Eric

15
00:01:17.971 --> 00:01:21.529
asked. Dad smiled.

16
00:01:21.530 --> 00:01:28.758
"I have a surprise."

17
00:01:28.759 --> 00:01:39.294
Dad took Eric into the garage.

18
00:01:39.295 --> 00:01:47.027
"A drum set!" cried Eric.

19
00:01:47.028 --> 00:01:50.834
It was Dad's old drum set.

20
00:01:50.835 --> 00:01:55.988
The set had three drums and cymbals.

21
00:01:55.989 --> 00:02:00.819
Dad gave Eric the drumsticks.

22
00:02:00.820 --> 00:02:07.085
He showed Eric how to hold them.

23
00:02:07.086 --> 00:02:09.327
Eric hit the drums fast.

24
00:02:09.328 --> 00:02:11.991
Tat! Tat! Tat!

25
00:02:11.992 --> 00:02:18.261
Eric banged the cymbals. Clash!

26
00:02:18.262 --> 00:02:22.153
"I hear music!" someone said.

27
00:02:22.154 --> 00:02:26.034
Eric looked up and saw Mom.

28
00:02:26.035 --> 00:02:30.017
She had her guitar.

29
00:02:30.018 --> 00:02:34.059
Dad held up his harmonica.

30
00:02:34.060 --> 00:02:41.186
Eric grinned. "We've got a family band.

31
00:02:41.187 --> 00:02:57.840
Let's play!"

